RELEASE BRANCH:
     A release branch is a temporary branch created from the develop branch,A release branch is used to stabilize, test, and finalize code 
before merging into production (main).
Main Purpose:
Final testing (QA, UAT)
Bug fixing (only critical fixes)
Versioning
Preparing production-ready code 
******************************************
HERE IS THE JENKINS PIPELINE FOR RELEASE BRANCH IN APPLICATION REPO
pipeline {
    agent any

    tools {
        maven 'maven'
    }

    parameters {
